# Build context is the repo root (apps/api/Dockerfile). Keep it small and secret-free.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
.github
.local
.data
docs
apps/macos
# Only the manifests of other workspace packages, so the lockfile still matches.
apps/web/*
!apps/web/package.json
e2e/*
!e2e/package.json
